  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Puck / Plex\nHost, Docker, Proton VPN, and Plex logs on **puck** (`192.168.1.8`). Auto-refresh 30s.\n\n- **TV / Movies:** `/mnt/usbdrive`\n- **Plex usage:** [puck-plex-usage](/d/puck-plex-usage)\n- **qBittorrent** is kill-switched through Gluetun (Switzerland)",
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Host CPU",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoria-metrics"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      }
    },
